  "_readme": "BeamRunner online services: Google Play Games (Android) and Game Center + iCloud (iOS). See Scripts/Runtime/Services/README.md (Online services). Every id is empty by default and an empty id hides that feature, so this file as shipped turns everything online off. Fill in the leaderboard and achievement ids from the Play Console (Play Games Services > Leaderboards / Achievements) and App Store Connect (Game Center). cloudSaveAndroid needs Saved Games enabled in the Play Console; cloudSaveIos makes the iOS build add the iCloud (key-value storage) capability. simulateInEditor: simulated sign-in, leaderboards, achievements and a file-backed cloud save in the Editor and development builds. Keys starting with _ are ignored.",

